If you stop and start an instance it will change the IP address and assign you a new IP address.
Jenkins by default will not update this instead we should do one of the following.

/var/lib/jenkins/jenkins.model.jenconf.xml   ---> update new ip here and restart Jenkins
or
you can go to settings --> system --> Jenkins URL and update it with the new IP address
